# Local editor and assistant tooling: scratch state, machine-specific config, and the
# task-by-task working plans written against it. All of it holds absolute paths and
# working history, so it stays out of the repository.
#
# These are listed here rather than in .git/info/exclude on purpose: an exclude file is
# local to one clone and does not travel, so a fresh clone would start committing this
# material again. The design documents in docs/design and the measurements in
# docs/decisions are the record that is meant to be shared.
.claude-flow/
.superpowers/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
docs/plans/
